[2025-06-14T17:11:32.234180+00:00] logger.ERROR: CONTACT-US-FORM-ERROR {"name":"Winston","email":"winstonredford51@gmail.com","phone":"319-435-1790‬","message":"Winston here from Iowa. I'm just now starting to build out custom GPT's for people and wondered if you'd like one.  They don't cost anything to maintain or create - so the price is right.\r\n\r\nWhat could you do with it or what could it do?  Anything you want really, an interactive version of yourself people could use, an interactive version of a book(s), videos, manuals etc.  You could have it field customer questions, steer them towrds specific URLs on your site, product pages, etc.  I just made one for the other day for someone that queries all of his meeting transcripts from zoom calls, emails, even transcribed phone calls. It's a perfect way to remind yourself of things you've talked about in meetings/phone calls/emails with a simple question answer interface before a callback.  This example would be for If you wanted to use it for a personal use case but you get the idea - skys the limit.  If you can think of it I can make it.\r\n\r\nWhy do any of this at all?\r\n\r\nThere's over 800 million chatGPT uses every week, about 122 million a day.  You could have your own GPT in the mix of those users - people could see your products/services, ask questions about them, etc and it would handle all of that.  You can even get ChatGPT to start mentioning your site, along with Siri, Alexa, etc. AI is new enough where this is going to be huge and it won't be long until someone has one that will take business away from you.  I guarantee it.\r\n\r\nAnyway, hit me up, I'd like to make one of these for you - for whatever use case you can dream up.\r\n\r\n\r\nAll the best,\r\n\r\n\r\nWinston\r\nCell: 1-319-435-1790\r\n‬Live Chat: https://goo.gl/5sbTx5\r\nSite: https://kutt.it/deserve"} []
