[2025-11-07T02:07:13.346861+00:00] logger.ERROR: CONTACT-US-FORM-ERROR {"name":"Michale Radford","email":"michale.radford@hotmail.com","phone":"740249634","message":"Life Unfiltered-How to Quit Smoking and Start Living Fully.\r\n\r\nWhat if this time was different? \r\n\r\nTRULY different? \r\n\r\nYou’ve probably tried to quit before.The patches that peel off, the gum with that awful chemical taste… \r\n\r\nEvery failed attempt leaves the same bitter taste. The problem was never your willpower. It was the method. A one-size-fits-all approach can’t work for everyone. \r\n\r\nSometimes you need to sit down, read, and reflect. Other times, you need an encouraging voice in your ear. \r\n\r\nThat’s why this program gives you everything you need, in the format that works for you: \r\n\r\nThe 121-Page Ebook. \r\n\r\nThe 1h 27m Audiobook. \r\n\r\nThe 36-Page Action Sheets.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.edition-888.com/shop/life-unfiltered-how-to-quit-smoking-and-start-living-fully/\r\n\r\n1. The « Life Unfiltered » Ebook (Your Action Plan)\r\n\r\nThis is the heart of the method, your strategy manual. Dive into 15 chapters that dismantle the cigarette con.\r\n\r\n    Perfect for: Focused reading, deep understanding of the method, and practical exercises.\r\n\r\n2. The Complete Audiobook (Your Coach in Your Pocket).\r\nTurn your commute, your workout, or your daily walk into a powerful reinforcement session. \r\n\r\nThe author’s voice will guide you, motivate you, and lock the key concepts into your mind. \r\n\r\nIn a moment of weakness, just put on your headphones and let us guide you through it.\r\n\r\n    Perfect for: Listening on the move, immersive repetition, and instant moral support.\r\n\r\n3. Your Liberation Action Sheets (Your Support System).\r\n\r\n    Perfect for: Staying focused on what truly matters: Your Freedom.\r\n\r\nhttps://www.edition-888.com/shop/life-unfiltered-how-to-quit-smoking-and-start-living-fully/\r\n\r\nDr. Alain Chevalier\r\n\r\n\r\n----------------------